/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Inequality\040Regimes\040Gender\054\040Class\054\040and\040Race\040in\040Organizations)
/Author (Joan\040Acker)
/Subject (In\040this\040article\054\040the\040author\040addresses\040two\040feminist\040issues\072\040first\054\040how\040to\040conceptualize\040intersectionality\054\040the\040mutual\040reproduction\040of\040class\054\040gender\054\040and\040racial\040relations\040of\040inequality\054\040and\040second\054\040how\040to\040identify\040barriers\040to\040creating\040equality\040in\040work\040organizations\056\040She\040develops\040one\040answer\040to\040both\040issues\054\040suggesting\040the\040idea\040of\040\215inequality\040regimes\216\040as\040an\040analytic\040approach\040to\040understanding\040the\040creation\040of\040inequalities\040in\040work\040organizations\056\040Inequality\040regimes\040are\040the\040interlocked\040practices\040and\040processes\040that\040result\040in\040continuing\040inequalities\040in\040all\040work\040organizations\056\040Work\040organizations\040are\040critical\040locations\040for\040the\040investigation\040of\040the\040continuous\040creation\040of\040complex\040inequalities\040because\040much\040societal\040inequality\040originates\040in\040such\040organizations\056\040Work\040organizations\040are\040also\040the\040target\040for\040many\040attempts\040to\040alter\040patterns\040of\040inequality\072\040The\040study\040of\040change\040efforts\040and\040the\040oppositions\040they\040engender\040are\040often\040opportunities\040to\040observe\040frequently\040invisible\040aspects\040of\040the\040reproduction\040of\040inequalities\056\040The\040concept\040of\056\056\056)
/Keywords (01\040Aug\0402006\054\040Gender\040\046\040Society\054\040Social\040equality\054\040Intersectionality\054\040Inequality\054\040University\040of\040Oregon)
